Many thanks for the response,

I'm familiar with R, but if anyone has any pointers as to how to structure this, eg the work flow, that would be very helpful, or better, has done something similar..

A basic question first, how do I access the mcds engine? I know I can send a command text file via the command line to mcds.exe, but does this engine have additional capability beyond what is displayed in the distance software in terms of the levels of stratification, i.e. is it possible to specify two levels of stratification in the command file?

